    "detailed_description": "<h1>PROJECT: STELLAR GIRLS</h1><p></p><br><h1>Project: Mirror</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome to the game Project: WATERFALL! Here you are the protagonist who draws lines to the heart of cute and beautiful girls in a fantasy world. Pass a lot of levels and get a hundred achievements. Have fun playing!<br><br><strong>Project: WATERFALL</strong> is a casual puzzle game whose main gameplay is to get water to the right place using simple drawing skills. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173910/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128655\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173910/extras/1f21a18a66479f6657e8ba8c04826ad4.avif?t=1718128655\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173910/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128655\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><br>Make your way through the many levels. To do so, you need to use simple drawing skills. The game includes many interesting levels. There is also a lot of romantic music, a lot of interesting scenes that open up as you go through the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lots of levels<br></li><li>Nice music<br></li><li>Beautiful images in your gallery<br></li><li>Easy gameplay</li></ul>",
